WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:02,660
The whole car is modified and weighs five tons

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:06,140
Wind resistance far exceeds that of ordinary cars in this weather

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,540
A heavier car is safer

4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,580
I originally wanted to deploy armored vehicles

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,700
But I can't drive

6
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,940
It’s not easy to run in urban areas either.

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:19,900
This car was urgently inspected by a local wealthy man and set off for this special trip.

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:25,020
You two stay here and wait for Director Chen

9
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,070
I only know our daily routine

10
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:30,530
It is to ensure the safety of Mr. throughout the entire process without any orders.

11
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:48,600
We can't leave. I was negligent, sir.

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,280
We are here waiting for your return
